  "description": "NOC wallboard — six fixed WAN uplink IN/OUT graphs. Each panel 8w×10h on a 24-col grid → 3×2 at ≥1920px. Zabbix datasource queryType=3 (itemid mode), one itemid per target as a string per the alexanderzobnin plugin contract. IN is green, OUT is blue, consistently across all six panels. refId A always = IN, refId B always = OUT. itemids were verified via host.get on 2026-10-04 but item.get access remains role-gated for nbzsync; apply-grafana.sh verifies them against the live Zabbix datasource before marking the dashboard provisioned."
